1
00:00:01,020 --> 00:00:03,820
我们要去圣巴巴拉拿摇篮车
So we're going to Santa Barbara to pick up the bassinet.

2
00:00:03,820 --> 00:00:05,400
或者我们省下5个小时
Or we can save five hours

3
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:06,980
直接去拐角处的婴儿市场
and go around the corner to baby town.

4
00:00:07,020 --> 00:00:08,090
你今天要干嘛
What are you doing all day?

5
00:00:08,090 --> 00:00:09,729
-杰 -没关系的 妈妈
- Jay! - It's fine, mom.

6
00:00:09,739 --> 00:00:12,009
怎么没关系 今天是曼尼的生日
No, it's not fine. Today's Manny's birthday.

7
00:00:12,009 --> 00:00:13,629
呀 孩子 真是抱歉
Aw, jeez. I'm sorry, kid.

8
00:00:13,629 --> 00:00:16,598
别担心 罗本一家要带我去吃生日午餐
Don't worry. Reuben's family's taking me for a birthday lunch.

9
00:00:16,598 --> 00:00:18,847
你看 连罗本一家都记得
You see? Even the Reubens remembered.

10
00:00:19,187 --> 00:00:20,377
我们会在6点回来
We'll be back at 6:00,

11
00:00:20,377 --> 00:00:23,197
然后带你去吃特别生日晚餐 好不好
and we're taking you to a special birthday dinner. Okay?

12
00:00:23,197 --> 00:00:24,566
-真要吗 -杰
- We are? - Jay!

13
00:00:24,566 --> 00:00:26,046
抱歉 孩子
I'm sorry, kid.

14
00:00:26,046 --> 00:00:28,265
我并不抱歉 那只是障眼法
I wasn't sorry. It was a setup.

15
00:00:28,265 --> 00:00:31,105
我们要给他办一个大型惊喜生日派对
We're throwing him a big surprise birthday party.

16
00:00:31,105 --> 00:00:33,934
他竟然完全信了 那个小兔崽子
And he totally fell for it, the little jerk.

17
00:00:33,984 --> 00:00:36,814
那正是惊喜派对的意义所在嘛
I mean, that's the whole point of a surprise party.

18
00:00:36,864 --> 00:00:38,593
你把自己真心爱的一个人
You take someone who you really love

19
00:00:38,593 --> 00:00:40,103
当傻子一样耍
and you play 'em like a fool.

20
00:00:40,103 --> 00:00:42,422
那才不是我们这样做的全部意义
That's not the whole point of all this.

21
00:00:42,422 --> 00:00:44,562
曼尼感觉自己有点受冷落
Manny has been feeling a little bit neglected,

22
00:00:44,720 --> 00:00:47,640
所以我想给他一个最特别的日子
and I wanted to give him the most special day.

23
00:00:47,771 --> 00:00:48,931
我们三个人单独庆生
This is the last birthday

24
00:00:48,931 --> 00:00:50,841
也就这最后一次了
that it's only going to be the three of us.

25
00:00:50,841 --> 00:00:53,160
我迫不及待想看到小宝贝了
I can't wait to see the little dope's face.

26
00:00:54,430 --> 00:00:56,030
然后那个自以为是的卡萝·曲就开始咆哮
...And then that smug Carol Chu was all,

27
00:00:56,030 --> 00:00:58,069
"没有环境影响报告是不能挖的"
"You can't dig without an environment impact study."

28
00:00:58,100 --> 00:00:59,120
然后我"嘭"地一下
And then I was like, "Bam!"

29
00:00:59,239 --> 00:01:00,769
把报告甩在了查理的桌子上
and then I slapped the study onto Charlie's desk,

30
00:01:00,940 --> 00:01:02,680
卡萝就在那里 "但 但 但是"
and Carol was like, "But--but--but--"

31
00:01:02,708 --> 00:01:04,608
然后我就说 "去"你妈的
and then I was like, "Chu on that!"

32
00:01:04,608 --> 00:01:05,338
你那么说了吗
You said that?

33
00:01:05,380 --> 00:01:07,760
没用嘴说 用我的眼神和潇洒的转体
Well, not with my mouth. With my eyes and my swivel.

34
00:01:08,660 --> 00:01:10,080
你呢 今天工作怎样
So how was your day at work?

35
00:01:11,220 --> 00:01:12,540
就那样 还行
Oh, you know, fine.

36
00:01:13,280 --> 00:01:13,720
是吗
Yeah?

37
00:01:14,980 --> 00:01:16,000
我真是个笨蛋
I'm an idiot.

38
00:01:16,020 --> 00:01:18,920
我知道小卡自从回去教书就一直很挣扎
I know Cam's been struggling since he went back to teaching.

39
00:01:18,920 --> 00:01:20,720
那些学生 那些教员
The students, the faculty--

40
00:01:20,724 --> 00:01:22,104
没一个好对付的
None of it's clicking.

41
00:01:22,420 --> 00:01:23,080
他绝不会想听到
The last thing he needed

42
00:01:23,080 --> 00:01:25,420
我最近工作有多成功
was me going on about my latest work triumph.

43
00:01:25,420 --> 00:01:27,310
之后情况更糟糕了
And then it got worse.

44
00:01:28,453 --> 00:01:30,992
二爸 快过来 我们的婚礼要开始了
Come on, daddy. It's time for our wedding.

45
00:01:31,122 --> 00:01:33,912
-什么情况 -莉莉和我要结婚了
- What's happening? - Oh, Lily and I are gettin' married.

46
00:01:34,401 --> 00:01:35,501
什么情况
Uh, what's happening?

47
00:01:35,501 --> 00:01:37,371
当她求婚的时候 我觉得有些诡异
When she proposed, I thought it was a little weird,

48
00:01:37,480 --> 00:01:39,660
但后来我查到有些女孩会经历这个阶段
but then I read it's a phase that some girls go through.

49
00:01:40,010 --> 00:01:42,330
-所以 -是 我只是觉得这超可爱
- So... - Oh, no, well, I just think it's the cutest thing ever.

50
00:01:42,330 --> 00:01:44,989
给你 二爸 我为你做了这枚戒指
Here, dad. I made you this ring.

51
00:01:45,859 --> 00:01:49,008
太太太太太可爱了
Cute, cute, cute, cute, cute, cute, cute!

52
00:01:49,038 --> 00:01:50,358
你有戒指要给我吗
Do you have a ring for me?

53
00:01:50,358 --> 00:01:53,347
莉莉 没有戒指就不是婚礼了
Well, Lily, it wouldn't be a wedding without a ring.

54
00:01:54,237 --> 00:01:56,417
耶 好有爱啊
Yay. Loving this!

55
00:01:56,417 --> 00:01:57,387
大爸 走开
Daddy, move.

56
00:01:57,387 --> 00:01:59,606
好吧 我猜我要坐在新郎那边
Okay, I guess I'll just go sit on the groom's side.

57
00:01:59,620 --> 00:02:01,640
得了 小卡 好玩而已
Oh, come on, Cam. It's fun.

58
00:02:01,716 --> 00:02:04,415
好玩 真是超好玩啊
Oh, it's fun. It's--it's super fun!

59
00:02:04,520 --> 00:02:06,920
你终于结婚了 万岁
You finally got married! Hooray!

60
00:02:07,514 --> 00:02:09,034
-嗷 -你还好吧 宝贝儿
- Oh! - Are you okay, sweetie?

61
00:02:09,300 --> 00:02:10,140
你觉得呢
What do you think?!

62
00:02:24,440 --> 00:02:27,260
真是百年难见的奇景啊
This is very rare indeed.

63
00:02:27,320 --> 00:02:30,750
奇葩书呆子回归自然本性
Geekus nerdipithicus in its natural habitat.

64
00:02:30,780 --> 00:02:32,860
-一如既往地独自一人 -我的摄像机
- Alone as usual. - Mine.

65
00:02:33,369 --> 00:02:34,509
嘿 拿回来
Hey, give it back.

66
00:02:34,509 --> 00:02:37,018
歌洛莉亚叫我给曼尼的生日会录像 妈
Gloria asked me to record Manny's birthday. Mom!

67
00:02:37,018 --> 00:02:39,318
艾丽克斯 还给你弟
Alex, give it back To your brot--

68
00:02:39,328 --> 00:02:40,997
算了 我实在懒得管
Mm, sorry. I tried to care.

69
00:02:40,997 --> 00:02:43,177
这是我上周在时装店赚的所有钱了
This is everything I made at the boutique last week.

70
00:02:43,177 --> 00:02:44,817
你全拿去 我就什么都没了
I'm not gonna have any money left for me.

71
00:02:44,817 --> 00:02:47,096
你在被学校开除之前就该想到这点
Should've thought of that before you got thrown out of school.

72
00:02:47,096 --> 00:02:48,386
你住在这里 就得交租
You live here, you pay rent.

73
00:02:48,396 --> 00:02:49,366
你以前可是个老好人
You used to be fun.

74
00:02:49,366 --> 00:02:51,845
以前 是吗 上大学的时候
You used to be--what? Oh, yeah, at college.

75
00:02:51,845 --> 00:02:53,105
等等
Uh, hang on. Wait.

76
00:02:53,105 --> 00:02:55,924
歌洛莉亚说今晚6点要给曼尼一个惊喜
Gloria says that we are surprising Manny 6:00 tonight,

77
00:02:55,924 --> 00:02:56,884
但她要我们4点就到那
but she wants us there at 4:00,

78
00:02:56,884 --> 00:02:59,004
就是说她要我们来布场
which means she's expecting us to do the setup.

79
00:02:59,004 --> 00:03:00,103
我说我们5点走
I say we leave here around 5:00.

80
00:03:00,320 --> 00:03:00,560
好的
Great.

81
00:03:02,560 --> 00:03:03,540
是我同事肯尼
That's Kenny from work.

82
00:03:03,540 --> 00:03:04,280
我去开
Oh, I'll get it.

83
00:03:05,002 --> 00:03:06,112
我们要去集市
We're going to a street fair,

84
00:03:06,122 --> 00:03:07,602
所以我们派对上见
so we'll just meet you guys at the party.

85
00:03:07,602 --> 00:03:09,251
你和这个新同事肯尼
Oh. You've been spending a lot of time

86
00:03:09,251 --> 00:03:11,101
-最近老是黏在一起嘛 -打住
- with this Kenny from work. - Stop it right now.

87
00:03:11,101 --> 00:03:12,401
有开始暧昧吗
Is it gettin' romantic?

88
00:03:12,401 --> 00:03:14,150
-没-- -是的吧
- N-- - Yeah...

89
00:03:14,150 --> 00:03:17,040
-其实嘛... -是的吧
- Well... - Yeah.

90
00:03:17,980 --> 00:03:20,920
妈 这是肯尼 爸 你们已经见过了
Mom, this is Kenny. And, dad, you already met.

91
00:03:21,020 --> 00:03:23,660
是哦 首先 肯尼 胡须真浓密啊
Uh, yeah. First of all, Kenny, sick ponytail.

92
00:03:23,660 --> 00:03:24,880
谢谢
Oh, thanks, man.

93
00:03:24,980 --> 00:03:27,060
-肯尼给我们店设计牛仔裤 -呵呵
- Kenny designs jeans for our boutique. - Uh-huh.

94
00:03:27,068 --> 00:03:28,567
提醒我了 给你带了东西
Oh! That reminds me. I got something for you.

95
00:03:28,700 --> 00:03:30,200
你穿多大的 32-34吗
What are you, a 32-34?

96
00:03:30,400 --> 00:03:31,640
你"多大" 36 38岁吗
What are you, 36, 38?

97
00:03:31,677 --> 00:03:33,886
-你是我肚子里的蛔虫吗 -穿上看看
- What are you, in my mind? - Put 'em on your body.

98
00:03:33,886 --> 00:03:34,826
好的 好的
Will do. Will do.

99
00:03:34,826 --> 00:03:36,336
菲尔 亲爱的
Phil, honey, d--uh--

100
00:03:36,400 --> 00:03:38,800
肯尼可是个名人哦
Kenny is kind of a big deal.

101
00:03:39,025 --> 00:03:40,545
那个时尚网站叫你什么来着
What does that fashion web site call you again?

102
00:03:40,545 --> 00:03:43,444
"牛才" 拼写和"牛仔"很像
a "Jean-ius." Spelled like "Jeans."

103
00:03:43,720 --> 00:03:44,200
真是愧不敢当
Mortifying.

104
00:03:44,244 --> 00:03:46,164
还有"衣架巨星"
And a "Rack star." Ohh.

105
00:03:46,653 --> 00:03:47,843
那个标题是什么来着
Hey, what was the headline again?

106
00:03:47,843 --> 00:03:49,723
对 "他是天命牛仔奇才"
Oh, yeah. "He's denim-ite."

107
00:03:49,723 --> 00:03:51,182
那你这周多尴尬呀
What an embarrassing week you've been having.

108
00:03:51,182 --> 00:03:52,182
是呀
Ooh. Yeah. Mm.

109
00:03:52,182 --> 00:03:54,652
我只是想保持鲜活的创造力
I'm just trying to stay fresh creatively, you know,

110
00:03:54,762 --> 00:03:56,201
把我的精髓融入男士服装里
made my bones in men's apparel,

111
00:03:56,380 --> 00:03:57,900
现在我正和当地的这些精品店合作
and now I'm working with these local boutiques...

112
00:03:58,581 --> 00:04:00,291
尝试涉猎女款牛仔
just trying to get into girls' jeans.

113
00:04:00,291 --> 00:04:02,150
-菲尔 -菲尔已经不在了
- Phil! - There's no Phil here!

114
00:04:02,180 --> 00:04:04,060
这牛仔裤太合身了
These jeans just slipped on me so perfectly.

115
00:04:04,060 --> 00:04:05,939
我已经改名为"牛仔灰姑娘"
My name must be pantsarella.

116
00:04:05,949 --> 00:04:07,889
赞 舒服吧
Boom! Comfortable, right?

117
00:04:07,889 --> 00:04:09,129
舒服得像尿布一样
Like a diaper. Mm.

118
00:04:09,240 --> 00:04:11,180
-我们该走了 -是呀
- Well, we should get going. - Oh, yeah.

119
00:04:11,668 --> 00:04:13,198
但是...你想说点什么
Um, but you wanted to say... Something.

120
00:04:13,198 --> 00:04:14,977
-对 是的 是的 抱歉 -说
- Oh, yeah. Yeah, yeah, yeah. Sorry. Yeah. - Okay.

121
00:04:14,977 --> 00:04:15,987
听着
Uh, listen...

122
00:04:17,360 --> 00:04:20,760
你弄得好像是给我们夫妻都送了牛仔裤
You made it seem like you had jeans for both of us,

123
00:04:20,760 --> 00:04:22,900
但是克莱尔没有拿到她的 所以...
And Claire hasn't gotten hers yet, so...

124
00:04:22,900 --> 00:04:25,860
-真是不好意思 -别担心
- I am so sorry. - Don't worry about it.

125
00:04:25,860 --> 00:04:26,510
给
Here you go.

126
00:04:27,900 --> 00:04:29,520
-要喜欢哦 -肯尼 你太赞了
- Enjoy. - Kenny, you're amazing.

127
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:30,500
-不是 -玩得开心
- No, man. - Have fun.

128
00:04:30,520 --> 00:04:31,240
你才是真的赞
You're amazing.

129
00:04:33,184 --> 00:04:35,063
我真喜欢他
I love him.

130
00:04:35,063 --> 00:04:35,783
菲尔
Phil!

131
00:04:35,783 --> 00:04:37,463
-你觉得他喜欢我吗 -菲尔
- You think he likes me? - Phil!

132
00:04:37,463 --> 00:04:39,792
那是个约会 他们要去约会
That is a date. They're going on a date.

133
00:04:39,792 --> 00:04:41,332
什么 他几乎跟我同岁了
What? He's practically my age.

134
00:04:41,332 --> 00:04:42,682
是的 对 对 对得很
Okay. Uh, yeah, right, right.

135
00:04:42,780 --> 00:04:44,440
什么样的中年男人会对一个
And what middle-aged guy would be interested

136
00:04:44,440 --> 00:04:47,660
年轻 漂亮 刚成年的女人感兴趣呢
in a young, attractive, newly legal woman?

137
00:04:47,660 --> 00:04:48,840
对了 所有中年男人都那样
Oh, that's right! All of them.

138
00:04:49,020 --> 00:04:50,220
不对 我就是个例外
That's not true. I wouldn't.

139
00:04:50,220 --> 00:04:50,520
真的吗
Really?

140
00:04:51,420 --> 00:04:52,540
赫敏·格兰杰不是吗
Hermione Granger?

141
00:04:53,119 --> 00:04:54,439
-什么 -嗯哼
- What? - Mm-hmm.

142
00:04:54,979 --> 00:04:56,339
我只是个"哈利波特"迷而已
I'm just a "Harry Potter" Fan.

143
00:04:56,339 --> 00:04:56,939
是啊
Yeah.

144
00:04:56,939 --> 00:04:58,898
她有长大成为一名可爱的年轻女士吗
Has she blossomed into a lovely young lady?

145
00:04:59,280 --> 00:04:59,940
是的 但是 卢克
Yes, but--Luke,

146
00:04:59,940 --> 00:05:01,480
我再也不告诉你任何秘密了
I'm never telling you anything!

147
00:05:03,617 --> 00:05:05,517
天啊 杰 快看 多漂亮啊
oh, my god, Jay! Look how beautiful!

148
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:07,280
你看看这多挤 书店却空荡荡的
Look at this. But the bookstore is empty.

149
00:05:07,360 --> 00:05:09,480
正因此中国才要领先我们了
That's why China's kicking our ass.

150
00:05:10,896 --> 00:05:12,395
不是吧 59号
Ay, no. 59.

151
00:05:12,395 --> 00:05:14,745
我们来太晚了 而且我们还得去取饮料
We're so late, and we still have to pick up the drinks.

152
00:05:14,745 --> 00:05:16,304
借过 不好意思 借过
Excuse me. I'm terribly sorry. Excuse me.

153
00:05:16,304 --> 00:05:18,204
先生 那正是我订的蛋糕
Sir? This is my cake right here.

154
00:05:18,204 --> 00:05:19,604
我直接付钱 然后拿蛋糕走人怎么样
How about I'll just leave money, I take it?

155
00:05:19,604 --> 00:05:20,404
先生 我要是答应你
Sir, if I did for you,

156
00:05:20,660 --> 00:05:21,460
就得答应所有人的要求
I'd have to do it for everyone.

157
00:05:21,580 --> 00:05:22,600
你就当我是个特例好啦
Not if you just did it for me.

158
00:05:24,260 --> 00:05:26,080
不好意思 不好意思
Excuse me. Excuse me.

159
00:05:26,472 --> 00:05:29,212
我们有急事 我们要举办生日派对
We're in a hurry. We have a birthday party.

160
00:05:29,212 --> 00:05:30,521
你怎么不早说呢
Oh, why didn't you say something?

161
00:05:30,580 --> 00:05:32,120
急着开生日派对的顾客真是"少见"呢
We don't see many of those around here.

162
00:05:32,120 --> 00:05:34,240
你以为我会被你恶劣的态度唬住吗
You think you can intimidate me with that attitude?

163
00:05:34,540 --> 00:05:36,580
-你以为我多大 -34[胸围]
- What do I look like to you? - 34!

164
00:05:37,330 --> 00:05:40,399
谢谢 但重点是我儿子在等着...
Thank you, but the point is that my son is waiting in--

165
00:05:40,399 --> 00:05:41,359
歌洛莉亚 跟他争不值得
Gloria, it's not worth it.

166
00:05:41,359 --> 00:05:42,159
我们不用求这些人
We don't need these people.

167
00:05:42,159 --> 00:05:43,879
-我们 -走吧 能找到更好的蛋糕
- Jay, we need... - Come on. We'll get a better cake.

168
00:05:44,548 --> 00:05:45,748
你疯了吗 我们怎么可能...
Are you crazy? How are we gonna...

169
00:05:45,840 --> 00:05:47,800
我有办法 打扰一下 女士
I've got it covered. Excuse me, miss?

170
00:05:48,760 --> 00:05:50,800
抱歉我刚才在里面那么大声嚷
I'm sorry I raised my voice in there,

171
00:05:50,800 --> 00:05:52,000
尤其是还当着小宝宝
especially in front of the baby.

172
00:05:52,037 --> 00:05:53,387
我知道他们是多么的敏感
I know how delicate they can be.

173
00:05:53,387 --> 00:05:55,376
你这么说真是太贴心了
Oh, you're so nice to say that,

174
00:05:55,386 --> 00:05:57,276
但他们其实比你想象中坚强
but you know they're sturdier than you think.

175
00:05:57,276 --> 00:05:58,445
实际上 每一天我都学到一些小...
In fact, every day I learn these little mir--

176
00:05:58,445 --> 00:05:59,655
行了 你保重
Yeah, take care now.

177
00:06:03,880 --> 00:06:04,760
嘿 宝贝
Hey, honey.

178
00:06:04,904 --> 00:06:06,714
二爸 包包里装的什么
Daddy, what's in the bag?

179
00:06:06,714 --> 00:06:07,983
是给曼尼买的生日礼物
Oh, it's a present for Manny,

180
00:06:07,983 --> 00:06:09,663
我还给你大爸买了小礼物
and I also got your other daddy a little something

181
00:06:09,663 --> 00:06:11,313
因为他今天心情不太好
'cause he's been feeling down today.

182
00:06:11,313 --> 00:06:12,373
你的眼睛怎么样了 宝贝
How's your eye, sweetie?

183
00:06:12,540 --> 00:06:13,880
没事了 只是小伤而已
Oh, it's fine. It's just a scratch.

184
00:06:13,880 --> 00:06:15,060
我们这边走 亲爱的
Let's go this way, honey.

185
00:06:15,092 --> 00:06:17,192
小卡 你要穿西服去曼尼的生日派
Oh, Cam, are you wearing a suit to Manny's birthd--

186
00:06:18,391 --> 00:06:20,211
好 来摘掉你的绷带
Okay, let's get your hospital band off.

187
00:06:20,211 --> 00:06:21,161
我喜欢这绷带
I like it.

188
00:06:21,161 --> 00:06:23,780
-就当作"蓝色物品"吧 -小卡
- Okay, that can be your "Something blue" then. - Cam?

189
00:06:24,040 --> 00:06:25,870
大爸 我想开我的新车
Daddy, I wanna drive my car.

190
00:06:25,870 --> 00:06:27,339
什么新车 哇塞 新车
A car? Oh. A car.

191
00:06:27,339 --> 00:06:28,239
马上就好 亲爱的
Just a second, sweetie.

192
00:06:28,239 --> 00:06:31,319
谁有理由不让这两位新人成婚
Okay, does anyone know a reason why these two shouldn't be wed?

193
00:06:31,580 --> 00:06:32,220
她是我老婆
She's my wife.

194
00:06:32,578 --> 00:06:35,838
那么以糖果帝国授予我的权利...
Okay, so by the power vested in me by the State of Candy Land...

195
00:06:35,900 --> 00:06:36,560
犹他州授予的吧
And Utah.

196
00:06:36,657 --> 00:06:38,497
我宣布你们正式结为夫妻
I now pronounce you husband and wife.

197
00:06:38,497 --> 00:06:40,946
大爸 我可以去玩我的新车了吗
Daddy, I wanna play with my car now.

198
00:06:40,946 --> 00:06:42,016
当然可以 去吧 宝贝
Okay. Of course. Yes, sweetie.

199
00:06:42,220 --> 00:06:44,460
但记着 我们要顺着迎宾队列徐徐走过
But remember, we have to walk down the receiving line.

200
00:06:46,120 --> 00:06:47,460
噢 真是漂亮的出场
Oh! What a turnout.

201
00:06:51,074 --> 00:06:52,304
小卡 你居然给她买了辆车
Cam, y-you got her a car?

202
00:06:52,304 --> 00:06:53,854
我无法忍受你娶她竟然舍不得花钱
I can't help it that you skimped on your wedding.

203
00:06:53,854 --> 00:06:56,153
听着 我知道这一切背后的原因是什么
Okay, look, I-I know what's underneath all this, all right?

204
00:06:56,240 --> 00:06:57,640
现在你的生活中
Right now in your life,

205
00:06:57,640 --> 00:06:59,800
-你感到非常... -错
- you're feeling, you know, very... - No.

206
00:06:59,800 --> 00:07:02,900
请不要把我和女儿结婚说得那么丑陋
Please do not turn me marrying my daughter into something ugly.

207
00:07:03,072 --> 00:07:05,211
莉莉只是在经历一个人生阶段...
Lily is having the time of her--

208
00:07:07,741 --> 00:07:08,771
小卡
Cam!

209
00:07:08,771 --> 00:07:10,110
拜托 那不是我的错
Oh, please. Do not blame me.

210
00:07:10,280 --> 00:07:12,040
你我都早有预料 她很可能
We always knew there was a strong possibility

211
00:07:12,200 --> 00:07:13,160
会是个糟糕的司机
she'd be a terrible driver.

212
00:07:17,480 --> 00:07:19,220
克莱尔 我知道我们晚了
I know we're running late, Claire.

213
00:07:19,320 --> 00:07:19,960
我们马上就到
We'll be there soon.

214
00:07:20,040 --> 00:07:21,260
你们先开始布置吧
Just start setting up.

215
00:07:21,340 --> 00:07:22,540
你说"真是个意外"是什么意思
What do you mean, "Surprise, surprise"?

216
00:07:23,657 --> 00:07:25,367
等等 我得挂了 你先忙着吧
Hang on. I've gotta go. You take care.

217
00:07:25,367 --> 00:07:27,517
-怎么了 -杰 我找不到停车票了
- What's the matter? - Jay, I can't find the parking ticket.

218
00:07:27,517 --> 00:07:29,406
别着急 一切都会好起来的
Calm down. Everything's gonna be fine.

219
00:07:29,766 --> 00:07:30,956
太好了 是个男服务生
Oh, good. It's a male attendant.

220
00:07:31,020 --> 00:07:31,700
你什么意思
What does that mean?

221
00:07:31,820 --> 00:07:33,600
想想我不在的话 你会怎么给自己解围
How would you get out of this situation if I wasn't here?

222
00:07:34,820 --> 00:07:35,520
你好哥们
Hey, pal,

223
00:07:35,520 --> 00:07:37,180
我家保姆找不到停车票了
My housekeeper forgot her ticket.

224
00:07:37,180 --> 00:07:39,540
你们得倒回去 然后到三层的
You're going to need to back up, go up to the third level,

225
00:07:39,540 --> 00:07:40,920
付款台去付停车费
and find the pay station.

226
00:07:41,084 --> 00:07:43,633
你就不能放我们过去吗
Ay, you can't just let us go?

227
00:07:43,773 --> 00:07:47,272
我肯定是放在哪儿了 但就是找不到
I know I put it somewhere here but I cannot find it now.

228
00:07:47,300 --> 00:07:48,960
去付款台 在三层
Pay station. Third level.

229
00:07:49,422 --> 00:07:51,232
你先放我们走嘛
Maybe you can let us go now,

230
00:07:51,232 --> 00:07:53,691
下次人家一次性给你"两次"好吗
and then next time I do you two times?

231
00:07:53,691 --> 00:07:54,921
你们想出去 唯一的办法就是
The only way you're going to get out

232
00:07:54,931 --> 00:07:56,191
回到付款台交费
is to go back to the pay station.

233
00:07:56,260 --> 00:07:57,460
实际上 还有一个办法
Actually, there is another way.

234
00:08:01,709 --> 00:08:02,799
你还好吗
You okay?

235
00:08:02,839 --> 00:08:04,879
好极了 我们再去撞几个栏
Let's drive through something else!

236
00:08:05,180 --> 00:08:08,260
盛大的庆典马上就要开始了
The gala celebration is only minutes away.

237
00:08:08,260 --> 00:08:09,960
到处是美味的饮品
Delectable refreshments,

238
00:08:09,960 --> 00:08:11,200
兴奋的小同学们
excited classmates,

239
00:08:11,200 --> 00:08:14,800
这是什么 世上最美的景象不过如此
And what's this? The most beautiful sight of all?

240
00:08:14,800 --> 00:08:15,840
走开
Go away!

241
00:08:17,240 --> 00:08:19,380
他一把年纪 她年轻貌美 真恶心
He's old. She's young. It's gross.

242
00:08:19,380 --> 00:08:20,800
亲爱的 他们没什么的
Honey, nothing's happening.

243
00:08:20,800 --> 00:08:23,400
年轻人总是喜欢向长辈学习
Young people seek out older mentors all the time.

244
00:08:23,400 --> 00:08:24,080
当年我17岁时
When I was 17,

245
00:08:24,215 --> 00:08:26,364
我和我朋友斯黛西的妈妈走得很近
I was really close with my friend Stacy's mom.

246
00:08:26,394 --> 00:08:27,934
罗宾逊女士以前也是拉拉队员
Mrs. Robinson was a former cheerleader,

247
00:08:28,060 --> 00:08:30,240
她特别清楚训练后该如何给我按摩大腿
so she knew just how to massage my legs after practice.

248
00:08:30,443 --> 00:08:32,313
她有一种自制的缓解肌肉酸痛的药膏
She had her own homemade Bengay that didn't burn

249
00:08:32,320 --> 00:08:33,720
无论怎么在身上蹭都不会有灼热感
no matter where she rubbed it on me.

250
00:08:33,720 --> 00:08:34,920
如果我有机会去她那里
If I had the chance to go over there,

251
00:08:34,920 --> 00:08:36,160
我不会错过任何机会的
I never missed an opportunity.

252
00:08:36,180 --> 00:08:37,820
我想你错过了很多"鸡会"
I think maybe you did.

253
00:08:38,320 --> 00:08:40,380
我把礼物忘在车里了
Oh, I forgot the present in the car.

254
00:08:40,380 --> 00:08:42,740
好吧 你去取 我去放个"水"
Oh. All right. I'm gonna go take a squirt while you grab it.

255
00:08:44,660 --> 00:08:45,560
-好笑吧 -好爱我们俩
- I know! - I love us!

256
00:08:45,560 --> 00:08:46,990
太有才了
It's crazy!

257
00:08:52,549 --> 00:08:54,068
-我要揍死他 -菲尔
- I'm gonna fight him. - Phil.

258
00:08:54,068 --> 00:08:56,648
别拦我 克莱尔 我要狠狠揍他一顿
No, Claire, I'm gonna fight him up real nice.

259
00:08:56,800 --> 00:08:58,240
要不还是先威胁他一下吧
How about you start with a threat?

260
00:08:59,627 --> 00:09:01,357
克莱尔 你能帮我一把吗
Hey, Claire, um, could you help me with this?

261
00:09:01,357 --> 00:09:02,247
行行行
Yeah, yeah, yeah. Yeah.

262
00:09:02,247 --> 00:09:03,416
你到那边去
Yeah, you gotta go around the other side.

263
00:09:03,416 --> 00:09:05,116
-我得盯着点菲尔 -怎么了
- I need to keep my eyes on Phil. - Ooh, what's happening?

264
00:09:05,120 --> 00:09:07,280
他马上要去把海莉的新男友吓跑
He's about to drop the hammer on Haley's new boyfriend.

265
00:09:07,280 --> 00:09:09,540
他比她大一倍 太令人作呕了
He's twice her age, and it's disgusting.

266
00:09:09,675 --> 00:09:10,195
是啊 让我想起
Yeah, reminds me of

267
00:09:10,195 --> 00:09:12,984
你当年约会过的某奶酪工厂的小经理
a certain manager at the Cheesecake Factory that you dated.

268
00:09:12,984 --> 00:09:14,334
你说陶德啊
Oh. Todd.

269
00:09:14,334 --> 00:09:16,014
他可是有车又有权
He had a camaro... and power.

270
00:09:16,014 --> 00:09:19,103
他糟透了 你跟他约会就是为了气老爸
Ugh! He was nasty. You just did it to get a rise out of dad.

271
00:09:19,103 --> 00:09:20,423
是啊 但事与愿违
Yeah, well, look how well that worked out.

272
00:09:20,423 --> 00:09:22,482
老爸一点反应都没有 而我却落了个
It didn't bother dad at all, and then I was stuck with a guy

273
00:09:22,482 --> 00:09:23,292
身上一股土豆皮味
who smelled like potato skins

274
00:09:23,292 --> 00:09:25,032
且用"倘若"这种蹩脚词的男友
and said "Supposably".

275
00:09:25,032 --> 00:09:26,911
你必须承认 老爸那招还挺灵的
Well, you have to admit, dad played that pretty brilliantly.

276
00:09:26,911 --> 00:09:28,221
没过几周
You know, after a few weeks,

277
00:09:28,300 --> 00:09:30,240
你就厌倦了那男人 把他给甩了
you got bored with him, and then you dumped him.

278
00:09:30,240 --> 00:09:31,300
是啊
I did.

279
00:09:31,300 --> 00:09:32,920
我狠狠把他给甩了
I dumped him up real nice.

280
00:09:34,350 --> 00:09:35,879
-菲尔 -克莱尔 拜托
- Phil. - Claire. Oh, come on.

281
00:09:35,879 --> 00:09:37,629
菲尔 千万别对肯尼说任何话
Phil, you can't say anything to Kenny.

282
00:09:37,819 --> 00:09:38,969
-什么 -不行
- What? - No.

283
00:09:38,969 --> 00:09:40,868
我知道海莉为什么这样做
I know why Haley is doing this.

284
00:09:40,868 --> 00:09:43,138
她是为了报复你对她那么严厉
She's doing it to get back at you for being so hard on her.

285
00:09:43,148 --> 00:09:44,518
我当初也是这么对付我爸的
I did the same thing to my dad.

286
00:09:44,518 --> 00:09:46,067
首先 我跟你爸可不一样
First of all, I'm not your dad.

287
00:09:46,067 --> 00:09:47,717
而且你觉得我会任由她跟他约会吗
And do you think I'm just gonna let this happen?

288
00:09:47,960 --> 00:09:49,780
相信我 你越是生气
Trust me. The more it bothers you,

289
00:09:49,780 --> 00:09:51,060
他呆的时间就越长
the longer he stays.

290
00:09:51,060 --> 00:09:52,420
而我们越是坐视不管...
The more we ignore it...

291
00:09:54,435 --> 00:09:55,625
来击个掌 老爹
Up top, dad!

292
00:09:57,680 --> 00:09:58,040
好耶
Yeah!

293
00:09:58,880 --> 00:09:59,600
搞定
Nailed it.

294
00:09:59,600 --> 00:10:01,760
那位威利·尼尔森就会越早走人
...the sooner Willie Nelson's on the road again.

295
00:10:02,820 --> 00:10:04,380
我好纠结
I'm so conflicted.

296
00:10:04,380 --> 00:10:06,040
我脑子里知道你说得有道理
What you're saying makes sense up here,

297
00:10:06,193 --> 00:10:07,473
我心里却不能接受
but it's not what I wanna do here.

298
00:10:07,473 --> 00:10:09,912
我臀部这里却感觉好舒服
And I just feel so damn comfortable down here.

299
00:10:11,122 --> 00:10:13,042
忘了告诉你 我把那东西放在"后背箱"里了
I forgot to tell ya I put that in the trunk.

300
00:10:13,042 --> 00:10:15,451
知道 我不得不伸到你的裤子下面去拿
Oh, I know. I had to reach under your jeans.

301
00:10:16,961 --> 00:10:18,310
-难以置信啊 -我们太有才了
- I can't believe that! - We're so crazy!

302
00:10:18,320 --> 00:10:20,140
你个小可爱
It's adorable!

303
00:10:20,760 --> 00:10:22,030
出去转转吧
Wanna see outside?

304
00:10:22,030 --> 00:10:23,099
好啊
yeah.

305
00:10:25,620 --> 00:10:27,180
宝贝 我给你买了饼干
Sweetie, I brought you a cookie.

306
00:10:27,758 --> 00:10:30,258
我在急诊室吃过了
I ate at the emergency room.

307
00:10:31,018 --> 00:10:32,038
你那眼罩贴合得很完美啊
You worked that in seamlessly.

308
00:10:32,038 --> 00:10:33,487
别这样 那只是场意外
Oh, come on. It was-- it was an accident.

309
00:10:33,860 --> 00:10:35,440
别再自责了 走 我们也一起乐去
Stop beating yourself up. Hey, let's go mingle.

310
00:10:35,440 --> 00:10:36,240
不 其实吧
No. You know what?

311
00:10:36,340 --> 00:10:37,800
我有几个学生在这 我现在...
Some of my students are here, and I'm just--

312
00:10:37,800 --> 00:10:39,680
-我没那个心情 -好吧
-I'm not in the mood. -All right.

313
00:10:39,846 --> 00:10:41,845
小卡 我们得谈谈了 我知道你在闹什么别扭
Cam, we're gonna talk about this. I know what's going on.

314
00:10:41,845 --> 00:10:43,755
你肯定在学校工作不顺
You're obviously going through something at school.

315
00:10:43,755 --> 00:10:46,584
你心里挣扎难受 我还火上浇油
You're struggling, and I have just made things worse

316
00:10:46,620 --> 00:10:49,180
夸自己工作如何得心应手 没考虑你的感受
By bragging about what a hero I've been at work recently.

317
00:10:49,324 --> 00:10:51,243
但这不是在跟你竞争
And it--it's-- it's not a competition.

318
00:10:51,243 --> 00:10:53,353
我的成功就是你的成功
You know, my victories are your victories.

319
00:10:53,353 --> 00:10:54,433
你的失败就是我的失败
Your defeats are my defeats.

320
00:10:54,433 --> 00:10:55,712
塔克老师 他在这儿
Hey, Mr. Tucker! There he is!

321
00:10:57,242 --> 00:11:00,092
*拉动琴弦*
*Bow across a cello string*

322
00:11:00,092 --> 00:11:02,861
*弹奏钢琴*
*Piano keys a hammerin*

323
00:11:02,861 --> 00:11:06,750
*和声齐唱*
*Voices raised in harmony*

324
00:11:06,750 --> 00:11:10,549
*致我们亲爱的卡梅隆*
*For our dear ol' Cameron*

325
00:11:10,649 --> 00:11:11,989
爱你 塔克先生 你是最棒的
We love you, Mr. Tucker! We love you! You're the best!

326
00:11:11,989 --> 00:11:13,749
再见老师
Bye! Bye!

327
00:11:14,200 --> 00:11:15,520
是啊 确实像噩梦一般
Yeah, it's been a nightmare.

328
00:11:15,520 --> 00:11:17,870
谢谢你认为我不能应付自己的工作
And thank you for assuming I'm terrible at my job.

329
00:11:20,487 --> 00:11:21,857
不是的
No.

330
00:11:22,980 --> 00:11:24,480
我们到了 抱歉迟到了
Hey, everybody. Sorry we're late.

331
00:11:24,480 --> 00:11:26,180
我们路上遇到点事耽搁了
We got caught doing a bunch of stuff.

332
00:11:26,180 --> 00:11:28,060
或者什么事儿都不干
Or not doing a bunch of stuff.

333
00:11:28,296 --> 00:11:30,535
好啦 曼尼马上就到了
Okay, manny is going to be here soon,

334
00:11:30,600 --> 00:11:31,680
我们把步骤再过一遍
So let's go over the plan.

335
00:11:31,680 --> 00:11:34,240
听到他快进来时 我们把灯关掉
When we hear him coming, we turn off the light.

336
00:11:34,240 --> 00:11:36,240
他一进来 我们就把灯打开
Then when he comes in and turns it on,

337
00:11:36,240 --> 00:11:38,940
然后大喊"惊喜"
We all scream "Surprise!"

338
00:11:39,123 --> 00:11:40,593
有笔吗 我得记下来
You got a pen? I wanna write this down.

339
00:11:40,800 --> 00:11:41,760
他正从车道走过来
He's coming up the driveway!

340
00:11:41,873 --> 00:11:43,942
他来早了 大家各就各位
He's here early! Hurry up!

341
00:11:46,012 --> 00:11:47,012
快 快
Hurry! Hurry!

342
00:11:47,022 --> 00:11:48,301
嘘 嘘 嘘
Ahh, shh, shh, shh.

343
00:11:49,780 --> 00:11:51,520
快点 别让邻居看到
Quick. I don't want the neighbors to see us.

344
00:11:51,520 --> 00:11:52,460
你确定屋里没人吧
You're sure we're alone?

