523
00:18:40,544 --> 00:18:43,203
而且那家餐厅相当远
Also, uh, this restaurant is pretty far away,

524
00:18:43,203 --> 00:18:44,643
所以我们可能会待到很晚
So we might be out late.

525
00:18:44,643 --> 00:18:47,553
亲爱的 你只会年轻一次
Well, sweetheart, you are only young once.

526
00:18:47,563 --> 00:18:50,262
可能住酒店更好吧
Oh, might even make sense to just stay in a hotel.

527
00:18:50,380 --> 00:18:51,760
好的 都刷我们的卡
Okay. Put it on the plastic!

528
00:18:51,882 --> 00:18:53,061
太好了
Great!

529
00:18:54,320 --> 00:18:55,820
好啦 明天见
Okay. See you tomorrow!

530
00:18:56,300 --> 00:18:56,840
再见
Bye-bye.

531
00:18:58,180 --> 00:18:59,480
是我前妻
It's my ex-wife--

532
00:18:59,480 --> 00:19:00,700
不是好的那个
Not the good one.

533
00:19:01,220 --> 00:19:02,680
你想怎样
What do you want?!

534
00:19:03,420 --> 00:19:05,520
胆小鬼游戏玩得真好 克莱尔 她走了
Nice game of chicken, Claire. She's gone!

535
00:19:05,559 --> 00:19:07,458
她会回来的 我几乎可以肯定
She is coming back. I am almost positive.

536
00:19:07,600 --> 00:19:08,160
几乎
Almost?!

537
00:19:08,160 --> 00:19:09,960
为什么我要听你的 为什么
Why do I listen to you? Why?

538
00:19:09,968 --> 00:19:11,717
你说iPod是个失败的发明 是错的
You were wrong about the ipod being a failure.

539
00:19:11,717 --> 00:19:13,567
你说番茄是蔬菜 也是错的
You were wrong about tomato being a vegetable.

540
00:19:13,567 --> 00:19:16,696
我甚至不想提你最喜欢的"行星"冥王星
I don't even want to talk about your favorite "Planet" Pluto!

541
00:19:16,836 --> 00:19:18,826
而且除非她是对《观点》里的面善女主持撒谎
And unless she was lying to the good ladies of "The view,"

542
00:19:18,826 --> 00:19:20,895
人家名字是黛米 不是迪米[歌手]
It's "De-mi," Not "Dem-mi"!

543
00:19:24,345 --> 00:19:26,404
你居然让我和他一起离开
You were going to let me go with him?!

544
00:19:26,520 --> 00:19:28,040
那不正是你希望的吗 亲爱的
Isn't that what you wanted, honey?

545
00:19:28,560 --> 00:19:29,580
你是怎么回事啊
What's the matter with you?!

546
00:19:29,700 --> 00:19:32,180
我离开大学后你就一直表现很怪
You've been acting so weird ever since I left college!

547
00:19:32,180 --> 00:19:34,340
说清楚下 你不是离开了大学
For the record, you didn't leave college.

548
00:19:34,343 --> 00:19:35,402
你是被迫离开
You were asked to leave.

549
00:19:35,402 --> 00:19:38,142
你们永远不肯让我忘记这一点 尤其是爸
Oh, which you guys never let me forget, especially dad.

550
00:19:38,142 --> 00:19:39,831
亲爱的 你父亲...
Honey, your father--

551
00:19:39,940 --> 00:19:42,160
你不用告诉我他的想法
Oh, you don't have to tell me what he thinks, okay?

552
00:19:42,160 --> 00:19:43,680
我令他非常失望
I'm a huge disappointment to him.

553
00:19:43,700 --> 00:19:45,140
我每天都能从他的表情中看出这点
I see it on his face every day.

554
00:19:45,140 --> 00:19:47,080
他表现的根本不想让我出现在他身边
He acts as if he doesn't even want me around.

555
00:19:47,280 --> 00:19:48,340
给我停车票
Give me the ticket for the car.

556
00:19:48,340 --> 00:19:49,539
-菲尔 -我去追她
- Phil-- - I'm going after her!

557
00:19:49,539 --> 00:19:51,139
这个胆小鬼游戏也许对你爸有用
This little chicken game may work for you dad,

558
00:19:51,260 --> 00:19:53,160
但对我没用 那是我的宝贝女儿
but it doesn't work for me. That's my little girl.

559
00:19:53,349 --> 00:19:53,878
我要让她知道
I need her to know

560
00:19:53,878 --> 00:19:55,578
地球上没有男的能配得上她
that no guy on earth is good enough for her,

561
00:19:55,588 --> 00:19:58,407
更别说是什么媚俗的中年牛仔裤销售员
let alone some slimy, middle-aged jean salesman!

562
00:20:01,700 --> 00:20:02,520
什么情况
What's this?

563
00:20:02,520 --> 00:20:03,700
享受这一刻吧
Just enjoy it.

564
00:20:05,220 --> 00:20:08,220
人生中有着各种里程碑
There's all kinds of milestones in life,

565
00:20:08,220 --> 00:20:10,720
有你期望经历的
The kind you expect to live through--

566
00:20:10,765 --> 00:20:12,155
初吻
The first kiss.

567
00:20:13,460 --> 00:20:13,940
生日
Birthdays...

568
00:20:17,200 --> 00:20:17,680
毕业
Graduations.

569
00:20:17,680 --> 00:20:19,480
如果够幸运 一两次婚礼
If you're lucky, a wedding or two.

570
00:20:21,980 --> 00:20:23,880
甚至是家里增添了新成员
Or even a new addition to the family.

571
00:20:28,491 --> 00:20:29,161
还有你从未梦想过
Then there's the kind

572
00:20:29,161 --> 00:20:31,570
会再次经历的时刻
you never dreamed you'd get to live through again.

573
00:20:31,850 --> 00:20:33,420
好可爱
So adorable!

574
00:20:33,430 --> 00:20:34,570
太讨人喜欢了
So sweet!

575
00:20:34,570 --> 00:20:36,819
我的天
Oh, my goodness!

576
00:20:38,799 --> 00:20:41,108
看他 太完美了
Look at him. He's perfect!

577
00:20:43,678 --> 00:20:45,528
看他 好可爱
Look at him. He's so cute!

578
00:20:46,137 --> 00:20:47,897
那才是人生中最美妙的
And that's the best kind of all.

579
00:20:49,127 --> 00:20:51,036
我为什么要向你剧透
Why am I spoiling it for you?

580
00:20:51,080 --> 00:20:53,940
你会自己发现的
You'll see for yourself.

581
00:20:58,015 --> 00:21:00,214
-很痛苦吗 -是
- Oh, was it difficult? - Ay, si.

582
00:21:00,214 --> 00:21:03,264
那是我人生中最痛的20分钟
It was the most painful 20 minutes of my life.

583
00:21:03,924 --> 00:21:05,363
瞧啊
Oh, well, look at that!

584
00:21:05,363 --> 00:21:06,873
-你又苗条了 -是的
- You're skinny again. - Yeah.

585
00:21:06,873 --> 00:21:07,973
是的
Yeah.

586
00:21:08,323 --> 00:21:10,062
等等 他是我舅舅吗
So wait. He--he's my uncle?

587
00:21:10,062 --> 00:21:11,822
不 他算你半个小舅子
No. He's your half-brother-in-law.

588
00:21:11,822 --> 00:21:12,792
他是我们的舅舅
He's our uncle.

589
00:21:12,792 --> 00:21:14,071
半舅舅还是全舅舅
Half-uncle or full uncle?

590
00:21:14,071 --> 00:21:14,931
什么是全舅舅
What's a fuluncle?

591
00:21:14,931 --> 00:21:16,721
好啦 别觉得自己应该赖着不走
Okay, so don't feel like you gotta stick around.

592
00:21:16,721 --> 00:21:19,080
-我们明天见 -我们明天再来
- Okay. We'll see you tomorrow then. - Okay, we'll be back tomorrow.

593
00:21:19,080 --> 00:21:20,810
-拜 舅舅 -恭喜
- Bye, uncle. - Congrats.

594
00:21:20,810 --> 00:21:22,190
-再见 -他好可爱
- Bye. - He's adorable!

595
00:21:22,480 --> 00:21:23,680
可爱吗
Is he?

596
00:21:24,399 --> 00:21:26,889
我一点也不喜欢这小家伙
I don't like this one bit.

597
00:21:26,889 --> 00:21:28,198
我们详谈
We'll talk.
